data
  title What a cold start spends before your handler runs
  desc Four init phases, in order — parse + compile dominates and scales with bundle size
  sequences
    - label Provision + extract bundle
      desc Allocate the instance, pull and unpack the deploy artifact
    - label Parse + compile JS
      desc Dominant, size-proportional term — tens of MB of deps cost seconds of CPU
    - label Boot framework
      desc Load route manifests and instrumentation
    - label Dial connections
      desc TLS + DB handshake, 50-300 ms per instance, before the first query
